  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "TVB is Knoxville’s go-to bike shop, here to help you get the most out of cycling. Shop our selection online, schedule a service appointment, or visit us!",
      "Easy Rider is so here for August! \n\nTuesday August 11th:\n@ Sharps Ridge\nMeet at the 500 block of Hanover \n\nTuesday August 25th:\n@ Meades Quarry \nMeet at the Beer Trailer\n\nAll rides meet at 6:30. \nWe'll ride for about an hour, probably 4-6 miles.\nEasy Rider is a social group MTB ride.\nChill pace, snack breaks, no drop, and beginner friendly!\n\nWe will ride every other Tuesday.\n(the 2nd and 4th Tuesdays of each month)\nThe OPPOSITE Tuesdays at the AMBC social ride. \nSo you could ride every Tuesday if you attend them all!\nOur location changes each time so check back for updates. \n\n#Easyrider #socilaride #ambc @Ambcknox #EzRider #mtbride"
    ],
    "image_alts": []
